    {
      "id": "kpk1-l02-f2-t01",
      "before": "kpk1-l02-f2-e01",
      "title": {
        "en": "Żeby: so that"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "*Żeby* (so that, to) is followed by a verb's basic form, the *bezokolicznik*: *uczę się polskiego, żeby pracować w Polsce*, or *żeby studiować w Polsce*. A hobby is another reason: *to moje hobby*."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "kpk1-l02-f2-t02",
      "before": "kpk1-l02-f2-e09",
      "title": {
        "en": "His and her"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "\"His\" is *jego* and \"her\" is *jej*, and unlike *mój* and *moja* they never change: *jego mama*, *jego chłopak*, *jej mama*, *jej chłopak*."
      },
      "kind": "uwaga"
    }
  ],
